The AshlarOS installer starts on its own. If you closed it or chose to
stay here, run ashlaros-install to start it again.

A desktop session with Firefox is on tty2, for looking something up
during the install: switch with Ctrl+Alt+F2, and Ctrl+Alt+F1 to come
back. The installer keeps running either way.

For Wi-Fi, authenticate to the wireless network using the iwctl utility.
For mobile broadband (WWAN) modems, connect with the mmcli utility.
Ethernet, WLAN and WWAN interfaces using DHCP should work automatically.

The install log is at /var/log/ashlaros-install.log.
